{"title": "Elixir Supply Table", "pageid": 14435, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elixir_Supply_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables", "Leveled drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Elixir Supply Table</b>, also known as <code>Supply_Alchemy_Potion_Elixir</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supply_Alchemy_Potion_Elixir+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supply_Alchemy_Potion_Elixir+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> that contains elixirs, composed of rolls on the <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_Table\" title=\"Elixir Table\">Elixir Table</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drops\">Drops</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Elixir Supply Table}}</code>.</i>\n<i>The average roll on the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Elixir Supply Table</a> is 3 potions.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n  <tbody><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Quantity</th><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>4</td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Chance</th>  <td>1/3</td><td>1/3</td><td>1/3</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<i>The following is a list of all elixirs that can be dropped from <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_Table\" title=\"Elixir Table\">Elixir Table</a>. See <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_Table\" title=\"Elixir Table\">Elixir Table</a> for a detailed breakdown.</i><table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">All levels</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\" title=\"Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\" title=\"Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\">Elixir of Arcane Cultivation</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Barkskin\" title=\"Elixir of Barkskin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/36/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/ELX_